// Deepcore block definitions.
//
// BlockId is assigned by array position, and index 0 must always be air.
// `drops` lists the items a mined block gives (item IDs from items.ron).
// `pattern` drives the procedural atlas: Solid, Speckle, OreFleck(color), Gravel,
// Strata, Brick, Wood, Glow, Plate.

